Z||000000||Philphine||12-31-2000||03:31 PM||||<BR>just reading ralph's sale in the mall section. way more than i want to pay but each time i see a fiero in the balto. area i wonder about trying to get one and leave it there. half my siblings live in towson/balto. so one of them would have to keep it for me. then i'd have a car when i visit.<P>i guess to do something like that the car would have to be pretty simple since you wouldn't be there to do constant maintenance. plus i guess insurance would be weird. anybody do any thing even close to this. actually sounds like something rich people do but i like the idea if it were financially doable.<P>or it's just an attempt to somehow end up with more fieros and justify having them.||||reg||1
